            0.237
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Consider a triangle having three given sides of lengths 4 cm, 5 cm and 7 cm. Find its perimeter. Perimeter of the triangl "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\begin{aligned} e  &= 4   cm  + 5   cm  + 7 \\\\&= 16   cm .\\end{aligned}"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " cm"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.627,
            0.146,
            0.833,
            0.231
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 3,
              "bbox": [
                0.627,
                0.146,
                0.833,
                0.231
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_2_image_3.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.24,
            0.761,
            0.262
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Perimeter of a triangle = sum of the lengths of its three sides."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.279,
            0.59,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Akshi wants to put lace all around a rectangular tablecloth that is 3 m long and 2 m wide. Find the length of the lace required."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.36,
            0.209,
            0.38
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.391,
            0.592,
            0.482
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Length of the rectangular table cover = 3 m. Breadth of the rectangular table cover = 2 m. Akshi wants to put lace all around the tablecloth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.613,
            0.283,
            0.854,
            0.46
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.613,
                0.283,
                0.854,
                0.46
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_2_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.488,
            0.833,
            0.53
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, the length of the lace required will be the perimeter of the rectangular tablecloth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.156,
            0.535,
            0.833,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Now, the perimeter of the rectangular tablecloth = 2 × (length + breadth) = 2 × (3 m + 2 m) = 2 × 5 m = 10 m."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.611,
            0.608,
            0.631
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Hence, the length of the lace required is 10 m."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.113,
            0.65,
            0.835,
            0.67
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " Find the distance travelled by Usha if she takes three rounds of"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.672,
            0.385,
            0.692
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "a square park of side 75 m."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.71,
            0.208,
            0.729
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Solution"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.74,
            0.561,
            0.781
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Perimeter of the square park = 4 × length of a side = 4 × 75 m = 300 m."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.787,
            0.479,
            0.828
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Distance covered by Usha in one round = 300 m."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.155,
            0.832,
            0.563,
            0.875
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Therefore, the total distance travelled by Usha in three rounds "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 \\times 300    m  = 900    m"
            }
